oo big for him.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Stairs on the left. We take the second floor and dry out.", "name": "CAPTAIN", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Dry out, Captain? With what?", "name": "SERGEANT", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "With hope, Sergeant.", "name": "CAPTAIN", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "The Medic stumbles on a submerged rail.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "The Sergeant catches him by the strap and sets him upright without a word, and the Captain stops, turns, and watches the boy catch his breath before she moves on.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}]}